{
  "title": "Rain on Umbrella",
  "about": "Looking up through a rain-soaked umbrella at a blurred night city: drops land, sit, then slide down the dome leaving trails, each one a lens onto a sharper view of the lights behind (after Radiant's Rain on Umbrella by Paul Bakaus). Impacts can land on the beat.",
  "groups": [
